  designNotes: 'Amen (the user, 2026-10-16): it ends the Day when it resolves, with
    the spells: every other action still in the queue, both sides'', is discarded
    (their cards go to the discard pile), so no attack lands that Day. Single Use:
    it burns out.'
  artDescription: A choir of robed monks in a stone chapel snapping a giant hymn
    book shut with a thunderclap, every candle in the room blowing out at once, a
    single wisp of smoke curling up from each.
